# treadle 1
type Query class
	namespace Json
	static
	doc "Path lookups in a JsonValue: `a.b[2].c` names object members with dots and array elements with [index]."

function m0001 Find
	static
	returns Option<Json.JsonValue>
	doc "The value at `path` under `root`: Some(value) or None when a member is missing, an index is out of range, a step meets the wrong kind of value or the path is malformed. The value found is a view into `root` (root still owns it: do not Free it). An empty path gives the root."
